{"pageid":601,"title":"Bridge","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Bridge</span>","revid":20968,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Bridge</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bc/Bridge-LOWERED.png/revision/latest?cb=20230313193237\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Bridge-LOWERED\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bc/Bridge-LOWERED.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230313193237\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bc/Bridge-LOWERED.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230313193237 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bc/Bridge-LOWERED.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20230313193237 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Bridge-LOWERED\" width=\"270\" height=\"96\" data-image-key=\"Bridge-LOWERED.png\" data-image-name=\"Bridge-LOWERED.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay - Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"NPC\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">NPC</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Hyper Bridgeman - Sleepy Bridgeman(old) <p>Nobody(new)</p></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Connects the islands together together</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.4.1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 11th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Bridge</b> is a landmark in Oaklands. It connects <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater</a>. \n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Previous_functionality\">Previous functionality</span></h2>\n<p>When first added to the game, the bridge had a short span in the middle that was a drawbridge. Both the Finlay Island and Ferwater Island sides of the bridge were manned by the <a href=\"/wiki/Hyper_Bridgeman\" title=\"Hyper Bridgeman\">Hyper Bridgeman</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Sleepy_Bridgeman\" title=\"Sleepy Bridgeman\">Sleepy Bridgeman</a> respectively. For whatever reason, the bridgemen can't operate the bridge correctly.\n</p><p>For the bridge to come down, the player had to complete a \"Simon Says\" memory game by interacting with a panel with six buttons. These buttons flashed in a specific order. When initially added, the memory game went for a full 6 rounds, but it was later reduced to 3 rounds, before eventually becoming completely bypassed and simply activated by talking to either NPC. Once the memory game had been completed, the bridge would lower, allowing players to cross it. The bridge would then remain lowered for approximately 4 minutes, after which it would raise, and the memory game needed to be completed again.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Current_functionality\">Current functionality</span></h2>\n<p>After the island expansion update,the bridge was no longer a drawbridge and is just a normal bridge. The bridgemen were relocated, making it just a very plain normal bridge.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ded6e24eba5f1d67f3971ba6dd39b6b9\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:69px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"NewBridgeDrawbridgeOpen-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:43px; width:185px; top:12px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:NewBridgeDrawbridgeOpen.png\" title=\"NewBridgeDrawbridgeOpen.png (485 KB)\" style=\"height:43px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/75/NewBridgeDrawbridgeOpen.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240309194724\" title=\"NewBridgeDrawbridgeOpen.png (485 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"The new bridge, raised\" height=\"67\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"NewBridgeDrawbridgeOpen.png\" data-image-key=\"NewBridgeDrawbridgeOpen.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"The new bridge, raised\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"NewBridgeDrawbridgeOpen.png (485 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"The new bridge, raised\" height=\"67\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"NewBridgeDrawbridgeOpen.png\" data-image-key=\"NewBridgeDrawbridgeOpen.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"The new bridge, raised\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/75/NewBridgeDrawbridgeOpen.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20240309194724\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">The new bridge, raised</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:69px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Bridge-UP-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:67px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Bridge-UP.png\" title=\"Bridge-UP.png (385 KB)\" style=\"height:67px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1f/Bridge-UP.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230313192841\" title=\"Bridge-UP.png (385 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"The old bridge, raised\" height=\"67\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Bridge-UP.png\" data-image-key=\"Bridge-UP.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"The old bridge, raised\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Bridge-UP.png (385 KB)\" cl